title: "p4"
abstract: "Two Claude Code plugins: p4-phi, which keeps what linked sessions hand each other and retrieval from the project's own history; and p4-temportal, which keeps the project's auto memory in its store by Claude Code's own autoMemoryDirectory, leaves each session's scratchpad to the app, and gives the store's files lifetimes."
